"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Security in the pipeline — SAST, DAST, SCA and secret scanning tuned to a signal-to-noise ratio the delivery team accepts, with an agreed finding budget.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L41\\\",\\\"Continuous testing during the build — Not one test at the end. Testers work against each major feature as it lands, while changing it is still cheap.\\\",{\\\"as\\\":\\\"li\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"xmlns\\\":\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\",\\\"width\\\":16,\\\"height\\\":16,\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":2,\\\"strokeLinecap\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeLinejoin\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",\\\"1gmf2c\\\",{\\\"d\\\":\\\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\\\"}],\\\"$undefined\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Continuous testing during the build — Not one test at the end. Testers work against each major feature as it lands, while changing it is still cheap.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L41\\\",\\\"Pre-release penetration test — A full test before go-live by a lead tester who did not write the code, with the report issued to you unedited.\\\",{\\\"as\\\":\\\"li\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"xmlns\\\":\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\",\\\"width\\\":16,\\\"height\\\":16,\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":2,\\\"strokeLinecap\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeLinejoin\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",\\\"1gmf2c\\\",{\\\"d\\\":\\\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\\\"}],\\\"$undefined\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Pre-release penetration test — A full test before go-live by a lead tester who did not write the code, with the report issued to you unedited.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L41\\\",\\\"Monitoring and retest — Detections written for the system we built, and a retest cadence after launch. The loop does not stop at release.\\\",{\\\"as\\\":\\\"li\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"xmlns\\\":\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\",\\\"width\\\":16,\\\"height\\\":16,\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":2,\\\"strokeLinecap\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeLinejoin\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$L92\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\"]}],\\\"$L93\\\"]}]]}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"4d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"figure\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"dg\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"engagement-shape\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"dg-gantt\\\",\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 1000 252\\\",\\\"preserveAspectRatio\\\":\\\"xMidYMid meet\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"img\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Engagement shape for Custom Software: 6 phases. Phase 1, Discovery, Weeks 1–4, inside the engagement window. Phase 2, Design, Weeks 3–6, inside the engagement window. Phase 3, Build, Weeks 5–24, inside the engagement window. Phase 4, Test, Continuous, hardening in the last 4 weeks, inside the engagement window, producing the threat model and a clean penetration test report at go-live. Phase 5, Deploy, Launch window, no fixed window. Phase 6, Operate or hand over, Ongoing, no fixed window.\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"text\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"dg-axisUnit\\\",\\\"x\\\":0,\\\"y\\\":16,\\\"children\\\":\\\"weeks from kick-off\\\"}],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"g\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"line\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"dg-grid\\\",\\\"x1\\\